  "proof_rules": [
    "The attachment constructor supplied with an explicit origin assigns that point to f08 and initializes f28, f58 and f70 through the fresh zero point constructor.",
    "The nonnull absolute point owns the local note attachment array; the parallel local display cache uses the default null-source geometry.",
    "The disclosed no-leader source relations bind display direction to the normalized difference of text and absolute points. The candidate chooses the chart origin independently.",
    "Each ordinary UTF-16 code unit gets two equal zero-based positions. The generated line begins at zero and ends at the last character index.",
    "Fresh glyph and enclosing line metric values remain constructor state with the independently derived dirty flag."
  ],
